                                "sense_id": "c1e3638e-bf9e-3c88-87cd-848c63a7c2db",
                                "text": "During sleep, normal digestion is delayed or arrested altogether; and the sleeplessness may be directly ascribed in these cases to the presence of undigesting food, which is often indigestible and usually acid."
